---
import Layout from "@/components/Layout.astro";
import { renderer } from "@/lib/markdown";

const text = `
# Hi! I'm Redstone.

I'm a programmer, musician, Minecraft modder, gamer, and person.
I'm currently 17 years old and in 11th grade.

### About Me

I've been coding in some capacity since I was 6 years old when I
learned Scratch. When I was 7, I started learning JavaScript, and I've
been obsessed with programming since. It's one of my biggest passions
and I really enjoy doing it.

I am currently the lead developer of [The Broken Script](/projects/the-broken-script), a Minecraft horror mod with over 2 million downloads.
It's a big passion project and leans into several passions of mine, especially the love for a good internet mystery (ARG). I code, generate
ideas, manage the team, and write lore for it.

You can find my stuff here, on my [GitHub](https://github.com/RedstoneWizard08), on my [YouTube Channel](https://youtube.com/@RedstoneWizard08),
or [on this site](/projects).

If you want to support us developing The Broken Script, you can donate to our [Ko-Fi](https://ko-fi.com/thebrokenscript)!

### About this Site

This site was created as a way for me to show off the cool stuff I'm
working on, hopefully inspire others with [blogs](/blog), and have a portfolio.

The site is written with [Astro](https://astro.build), and uses Markdown and Astro's JSX for its content.

---
<br />

Feel free to look around! Check out my [skills](/skills), [projects](/projects), and [blogs](/blog).
`;
---

<Layout title="About Me">
    <div
        class="mt-8 flex w-full flex-col items-start justify-center px-8 md:flex-row"
    >
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <img
                src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94275204"
                class="h-60"
            />
        </div>

        <div
            class="markdown-content font-500 mt-8 mb-10 w-full bg-slate-900 p-6 md:mt-0 md:ml-8 md:w-160"
            set:html={await renderer.process(text)}
        />
    </div>
</Layout>
